rybook-button' is not a known element:  \r\n  1. If 'storybook-button' is an Angular component, then verify that it is part of this module.\r\n  2. If 'storybook-button' is a Web Component then add 'CUSTOM_ELEMENTS_SCHEMA' to the '@NgModule.schemas' of this component to suppress this message.\r\n\r\nNG0303: Can't bind to 'primary' since it isn't a known property of 'storybook-button'.\r\n\r\nNG0303: Can't bind to 'size' since it isn't a known property of 'storybook-button'.\r\n\r\nNG0303: Can't bind to 'label' since it isn't a known property of 'storybook-button'.\r\n```\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nClean angular repro generated with `npx sb@next repro` > `angular` > `angular`\r\nhttps://github.com/manuelmeister/storybook-repro-6-4-fail\r\nhttps://manuelmeister.github.io/storybook-repro-6-4-fail/?path=/docs/example-button--primary\r\n\r\nIt did not work as a production build either, so I changed the package.json to:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n\"build-storybook\": \"yarn docs:json && NODE_ENV=development build-storybook\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n**System**\r\nEnvironment Info:\r\n  System:\r\n    OS: macOS 10.15.7\r\n    CPU: (12) x64 Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-9750H CPU @ 2.60GHz\r\n  Binaries:\r\n    Node: 14.17.6 - ~/.nvm/versions/node/v14.17.6/bin/node\r\n    Yarn: 3.0.2 - /usr/local/bin/yarn\r\n    npm: 6.14.15 - ~/.nvm/versions/node/v14.17.6/bin/npm\r\n  Browsers:\r\n    Chrome: 94.0.4606.61\r\n    Edge: 94.0.992.38\r\n    Firefox: 92.0\r\n    Safari: 15.0\r\n  npmPackages:\r\n    @storybook/addon-actions: ^6.4.0-beta.3 => 6.4.0-beta.3 \r\n    @storybook/addon-docs: ^6.4.0-beta.3 => 6.4.0-beta.3 \r\n    @storybook/addon-essentials: ^6.4.0-beta.3 => 6.4.0-beta.3 \r\n    @storybook/addon-links: ^6.4.0-beta.3 => 6.4.0-beta.3 \r\n    @storybook/angular: ^6.4.0-beta.3 => 6.4.0-beta.3 \r\n    @storybook/builder-webpack5: ^6.4.0-beta.3 => 6.4.0-beta.3 \r\n    @storybook/manager-webpack5: ^6.4.0-beta.3 => 6.4.0-beta.3 \r\n\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nI think there should be a ComponentModule that is used with moduleMetadata and not individual definitions inside each Story.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/16228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/16228/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/comments/933702231","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/issues/16147#issuecomment-933702231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/16147","id":933702231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAzqfmc43pypX","user":{"login":"shilman","id":488689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODY4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/488689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman","html_url":"https://github.com/shilman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-04T17:33:26Z","updated_at":"2021-10-04T17:33:26Z","body":"Egads!! I just released https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/releases/tag/v6.4.0-beta.4 containing PR #16149 that references this issue. Upgrade today to the `@next` NPM tag to try it out!\n\n```\nnpx sb upgrade --prerelease\n```\n\nCl